It is now possible to select several one ore more activities based on specific criteria. Tow new options are in the top menu: 

(1) ***Select***: Picks one or multiple activity units according to the selection criteria: either all activities, all chemicals, 
all protein complexes, or activity units without evidence, activity units with comments, or disconnected nodes. 
It is also possible to select the inverse of what is selected, using "Invert selection".  carrying comments.
(2) ***Find in model***: Picks one or multiple activity units according to the search criteria: either a gene, 
a chemical, a reference, or an evidence. The user can choose to highlight a single activity unit, or all activity units matching the criteria. 

The selected activity units can be copied/pasted or deleted.

